config BR2_PACKAGE_REDROB_DATA
	bool "Redrob data partition image"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_E2FSPROGS
	help
	  Builds data.ext4, the initial content of the writable data
	  partition, from a plain directory with mke2fs -d. Needs neither
	  root nor a container engine. Replaces the upstream supervisor
	  data-partition builder.
